    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      69.82,
      97.65,
      541.29,
      115.93
    ],
    "text": "rejected by court. I have earlier pointed out that evidence Kularathne had been",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      69.72,
      121.66,
      541.37,
      139.93
    ],
    "text": "corroborated. For the above reasons I hold that the learned trial Judge was right",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      69.6,
      146.37,
      541.03,
      164.65
    ],
    "text": "when he decided to accept the evidence of Kularathne. Therefore I am unable to",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.664002418518066,
      13.698749542236328,
      13.699999809265137,
      14.346925735473633
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      69.7,
      170.6,
      509.21,
      188.88
    ],
    "text": "agree with the above submission of learned counsel for the accused appellant.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137,
      14.21342945098877
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      114.58,
      194.84,
      542.23,
      213.12
    ],
    "text": "One year after the disappearance of Nandasena, the accused appellant after",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137,
      14.21342945098877
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      69.7,
      219.08,
      542.19,
      237.36
    ],
    "text": "an exchange of words with Hemalatha over a monetary transaction, told her",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137,
      14.479144096374512
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      69.44,
      243.57,
      542.21,
      261.86
    ],
    "text": "(Hemalatha) to bring a mammoty to show the dead body of Nandasena. Hemalatha",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137,
      14.21342945098877
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      69.64,
      267.81,
      541.57,
      286.08
    ],
    "text": "says that she, thereafter, lodged a complaint in the police station. But the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      69.71,
      292.29,
      541.46,
      310.57
    ],
    "text": "investigating police officer does not confirm such a statement being made",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      69.27,
      316.52,
      473.64,
      334.8
    ],
    "text": "Hemalatha. Therefore it is difficult to rely on the said item of evidence.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.680935859680176,
      13.699999809265137,
      14.346925735473633
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      107.17,
      341.02,
      479.57,
      359.3
    ],
    "text": "The accused appellant, in his dock statement, denied the incident.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      110.51,
      365.25,
      541.58,
      383.53
    ],
    "text": "The learned trial judge when analyzing the dock statement stated that the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      69.23,
      389.48,
      541.16,
      407.77
    ],
    "text": "dock statement was not tested by cross-examination and that a statement could be",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.662097930908203,
      13.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      69.22,
      413.72,
      542.41,
      432.0
    ],
    "text": "considered as evidence only if it was considered by cross-examination. This is a",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.484098434448242,
      13.699999809265137,
      14.29234504699707
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      69.09,
      438.21,
      541.97,
      456.48
    ],
    "text": "misdirection committed by the learned trial judge. Judges when evaluating a dock",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      69.17,
      462.7,
      382.69,
      480.98
    ],
    "text": "statement should bear in mind the following principles.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      87.91,
      486.92,
      541.99,
      505.2
    ],
    "text": "1. Dock statement must be considered as evidence subject to the infirmities that",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.786011695861816,
      13.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      104.76,
      511.16,
      465.09,
      529.44
    ],
    "text": "it is not a sworn statement and not tested by cross-examination.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.680935859680176,
      13.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      86.8,
      535.41,
      415.79,
      553.69
    ],
    "text": "2. If dock statement is believed it must be accepted upon.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.397459030151367,
      13.680935859680176,
      13.699999809265137,
      14.362911224365234
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      86.72,
      559.41,
      541.77,
      577.69
    ],
    "text": "3. If dock statement creates a reasonable doubt in the prosecution case, defence",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.574121475219727,
      13.699999809265137,
      14.525197982788086
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      104.49,
      583.88,
      270.25,
      602.16
    ],
    "text": "of the accused must succeed.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137,
      14.346925735473633
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      86.58,
      607.88,
      529.07,
      626.16
    ],
    "text": "4. Dock statement of one accused must not be used against the other accused.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.362953186035156,
      13.699999809265137,
      14.21342945098877
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      68.78,
      631.88,
      541.14,
      650.16
    ],
    "text": "The above view was expressed in the case of Kularathne Vs Queen 71 NLR 529.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.954834938049316,
      13.699999809265137,
      14.21342945098877
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      69.1,
      656.12,
      461.88,
      674.4
    ],
    "text": "Similar view was expressed in Buddarakkitha Vs Queen 63 NLR 433",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.35351848602295,
      13.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      103.63,
      679.88,
      541.69,
      698.16
    ],
    "text": "When I consider the evidence led at the trial, I hold that the prosecution has",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      68.9,
      703.65,
      542.07,
      721.92
    ],
    "text": "proved its case beyond reasonable doubt and that above misdirection has not",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      589.7,
      765.7,
      608.6,
      859.13
    ],
    "text": "I",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      68.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      527.85,
      32.75,
      537.0,
      49.03
    ],
    "text": "6",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.199999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      61.78,
      69.22,
      536.83,
      87.63
    ],
    "text": "caused any miscarriage of justice to the accused. When I consider all these matters,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.531891822814941
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      61.59,
      93.46,
      537.02,
      111.87
    ],
    "text": "I intend to apply the proviso to Section 334 of the Criminal Procedure Code which",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.531891822814941
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      61.65,
      118.19,
      537.17,
      136.6
    ],
    "text": "reads as follows: \"Provided that the court may, notwithstanding that it is of opinion",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.399191856384277
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      61.16,
      142.42,
      536.81,
      160.83
    ],
    "text": "that the point raised in the appeal might be decided in favour of the appellant,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.265209197998047
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      61.54,
      166.9,
      536.86,
      185.31
    ],
    "text": "dismiss the appeal if it considers that no substantial miscarriage of justice has",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.344460487365723,
      14.399191856384277
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      61.79,
      191.39,
      172.06,
      209.8
    ],
    "text": "actually occurred.\"",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      100.28,
      215.64,
      537.34,
      234.05
    ],
    "text": "F or the above reasons, I affirm the conviction and the death sentence and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      61.81,
      240.11,
      171.28,
      258.52
    ],
    "text": "dismiss the appeal.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      61.68,
      264.84,
      167.76,
      283.25
    ],
    "text": "Appeal dismissed.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
